# TMCM Management System — Production-Ready Improvements

Act as a senior full-stack developer and database architect. Inspect the existing TMCM application, understand its current architecture, identify the root causes of existing issues, and implement the following improvements without breaking existing functionality or unnecessarily redesigning the entire application.

**Important:** Do not just provide recommendations or sample code. Make the actual changes in the existing codebase, connect the UI to the database, test the workflows, and fix any related bugs.

